    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm pregnant at 16</strong> \u2014 A visual novel about tough choices and their consequences.<br>This story will guide you through the heroine's experiences, her search for meaning, and her attempts to find her place in the world. Complex relationships with family, friends, and her first boyfriend force her to make important decisions that will shape her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you will lead the heroine through moments of joy and despair, through mistakes and redemption. Make choices that will affect her life, her relationships, and how she shapes her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Characters:</strong> Explore the heroine's relationships with her loved ones, friends, and her first boyfriend. Uncover their hidden motives and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story:</strong> The game touches on difficult topics such as love, responsibility, social pressure, and personal experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serious Themes:</strong> Issues like abortion, teenage pregnancy, and coming of age are not just plot points\u2014they are essential to understanding choice and self-identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor:</strong> Inner monologues, memes, chats, and awkward situations add some levity to the tense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the heroine's journey to the end and discover the consequences of her decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong><i>The backgrounds and music in the game are partially AI-generated. This allowed us to release the project for free. The characters (except the bus conductor), story, and script were created by real people.</i></strong><br><br><strong>Recommended Age Rating: 16+.</strong> By downloading the game, you confirm that you are aware of the recommended age rating.</p>",
